  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NORHED II PRICE Health Systems</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The PRICE &#x2013; Strengthening the capacity of the primary health case leaders education - project aims to increase the quantity and quality of education and research programmes within Primary Health Care (PHC) in Malawi and Zambia. In cooperation with the PRIMAFAMED network the project will disseminate knowledge throughout the African PHC network.</narrative>
  </description>
